@startuml spresense_main_board_process_view
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title プロセスビュー: Spresense メインボード\nスレッド構成・優先度・同期 (4+1 View - Process View)\n3 アプリスレッド + 1 NuttX kernel スレッド

' ==============================================================
' Threads (NuttX Tasks)
' ==============================================================
package "NuttX Tasks (Spresense メインボード)" #LightYellow {

  rectangle "🧵 **main task**\n(camera_app_main.c)\nprio=100, stack=8192\n責務: 起動・初期化・spawn\n   3 つの worker thread を pthread_create" as T_MAIN #LightGreen

  rectangle "🎬 **camera_thread_func**\n(camera_threads.c:~250)\nprio=100\n責務: V4L2 dequeue → frame 取得\n   frame_statistics_update (L2.C 入力)\n   → frame_queue_push(g_action_queue)" as T_CAM #LightCyan

  rectangle "🚚 **usb_thread_func**\n(camera_threads.c:~600)\nprio=100\n責務: frame_queue_pull(g_action_queue)\n   → MJPEG batch (BATCH_SIZE=2)\n   → tcp_server_send_with_reconnect()\n     または usb_transport_send_bytes()" as T_USB #LightCyan

  rectangle "🎛️ **control_thread_func** (Phase 10)\n(camera_threads.c:1330)\nprio=100\n責務: 10 Hz PID 制御ループ (100ms 周期)\n   queue_depth 観測 → fps_controller_update\n   → camera_set_fps_runtime\n   → apply_priority_boost\n⚠ Phase 11 (enhanced_control) は .c 未実装" as T_CTRL #LightYellow

  rectangle "📡 **gs2200m driver task**\n(spresense/nuttx/drivers/wireless/gs2200m.c)\nprio=50, stack=2048\n責務: SPI 経由 GS2200M 通信\n   send/recv シリアライズ\n   notif_q への通知投入" as T_GS #LightBlue
}

' ==============================================================
' 同期プリミティブ (アクセスされる共有リソース)
' ==============================================================
package "Shared Resources & Synchronization" #LightCoral {
  database "g_empty_queue" as Q_EMPTY <<shared queue>>
  database "g_action_queue\n(g_queue_mutex で保護)" as Q_ACTION <<shared queue>>
  database "g_fps_controller\n(control_thread のみ書込)" as FPS_STATE <<shared state>>
  database "g_frame_statistics\n(camera_thread のみ書込)" as STAT_STATE <<shared state>>
  rectangle "tcp_server (struct)\n(tcp_server.c)\n+ g_tcp_health\n  (tcp_server のみ書込)" as TCP_STRUCT
  rectangle "metrics_packet\n(usb_thread のみ書込)" as METRICS
}

' ==============================================================
' データフロー & 同期
' ==============================================================
T_MAIN --> T_CAM  : "pthread_create\n(camera_threads.c:1469)"
T_MAIN --> T_USB  : "pthread_create\n(camera_threads.c:1488)"
T_MAIN --> T_CTRL : "pthread_create\n(camera_threads.c:1516)"

T_CAM ..> Q_EMPTY    : "pull (空き取得)"
T_CAM ..> Q_ACTION   : "push (撮影完了)"
T_CAM ..> STAT_STATE : "update (frame.size)"

T_USB ..> Q_ACTION   : "pull (送信対象)"
T_USB ..> Q_EMPTY    : "push (解放)"
T_USB --> TCP_STRUCT : "send_with_reconnect"
T_USB --> METRICS    : "metrics 送信"

T_CTRL ..> Q_ACTION  : "depth 読取\n   (g_queue_mutex)"
T_CTRL --> FPS_STATE : "fps_controller_update"
T_CTRL ..> T_CAM     : "camera_set_fps_runtime\n   (V4L2 経由で間接作用)"

T_GS  ..> TCP_STRUCT : "tcp_health_*\n読取のみ\n(書込は T_USB 側)"

' ==============================================================
' 注意・観察
' ==============================================================
note as PROC_NOTE #LightYellow
  **🧵 プロセスビュー観察 (実装事実ベース)**:

  • **3 つの主要アプリスレッド + 1 つのカーネルスレッド (gs2200m)**
    - camera_thread (Producer)
    - usb_thread (Consumer)
    - **control_thread (Phase 10 PID, 10 Hz 周期)** ← 旧版で見落とし箇所
  • **g_action_queue は 3 スレッドが触る共有資源**:
    - camera_thread (push), usb_thread (pull), control_thread (depth 観測)
    - g_queue_mutex で排他制御
  • **書込権を 1 スレッドに集約 (race 回避)**:
    - g_fps_controller: control_thread のみ
    - g_frame_statistics: camera_thread のみ
    - g_tcp_health: usb_thread (tcp_server_send 内) のみ
  • **gs2200m driver task の責務は SPI 通信のみ**:
    - g_tcp_health 等のアプリ側 metrics には触らない
    - prio=50 (アプリより低い) → 高負荷時 SPI 遅延が構造的天井 #1 と相互作用

  **設計判断のポイント**:
  • Phase 11 (enhanced_control) は **.c 未実装** で control_thread 内のロジックは
    現状 fps_controller (Phase 10) のみ
  • control_thread が camera_thread に作用するのは V4L2 ioctl 経由 (間接)
end note

note bottom
  本図は **arc42 プロセスビュー / 4+1 View Process View** 相当。
  L1/L2/データビューと併読することで、システムの動的挙動が立体把握できる。
end note

@enduml
